<BaseLayout title="Donate"><article class="standard-page"><header class="page-heading wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Support the magazine</p><h1>Donate</h1><p class="standfirst">Help us keep independent Nordic literature and culture open to everyone.</p></header><div class="gh-content"><p><strong>The Scandinavian Quarterly is free to read.</strong> We do not put published work behind a subscription or paywall.</p><p>That choice matters to us: writers, artists, students and readers should be able to encounter the magazine regardless of whether they can pay for access.</p><p>Running an independent magazine still costs money. Donations help cover the practical costs of keeping TSQ online — including the domain, hosting, editorial tools, design, administration and future editorial development.</p><p>Donating is optional. Reading is not.</p><div class="donation-box stripe-donation"><p class="eyebrow">Support TSQ</p><h2>Keep the magazine free to read.</h2><p>Give once, in any amount you choose. Your donation helps us keep TSQ open to every reader.</p><div class="stripe-buy-wrap"><script is:inline async src="https://js.stripe.com/v3/buy-button.js"></script><stripe-buy-button buy-button-id="buy_btn_1UNrR02O2dzIdYwOGsojpC4h" publishable-key="pk_live_51UMrhA2O2dzIdYwOA8q70L7CPaBz2N3qftlOj2pUqzMGqFbcfVDF7DgcwrgYLlUXfclmsDjbD4qIAfP9x5tSvrZp00BjeBQ9Bz"></stripe-buy-button></div><p class="donation-fallback"><a href="https://donate.stripe.com/14A3co0byewZ2FD7C21Jm01" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open secure donation page →</a></p><noscript><p><a class="button" href="https://donate.stripe.com/14A3co0byewZ2FD7C21Jm01">Donate securely with Stripe</a></p></noscript></div><p>If you would like to support TSQ in another way, you can share published work, recommend the magazine to a reader, or send us work that belongs here.</p></div></article></BaseLayout>
